# mcp-former kubectl domain ontology — bundled tier.
# Loaded by tardygrada via mcpf apply or via tardygrada's startup
# scan. Drives the mcpf-kubectl wrapper's protection decisions.
#
# Conventions:
#   protected_namespace  — namespaces that hold cluster-critical state
#                          (kube-system etc.); blanket reject mutations
#   protected_resource   — specific named resources (coredns, kube-proxy,
#                          metrics-server) that should never be deleted
#                          even outside protected namespaces
#   destructive_op       — operations that destroy data irreversibly

# Protected namespaces — anything mutating in these requires
# --allow-unsafe.  "default" is intentionally NOT protected; it's
# the playground namespace.
<http://tardygrada.org/kube_system> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_namespace> .
<http://tardygrada.org/kube_public> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_namespace> .
<http://tardygrada.org/kube_node_lease> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_namespace> .
<http://tardygrada.org/cert_manager> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_namespace> .
<http://tardygrada.org/ingress_nginx> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_namespace> .

# Protected named resources — never delete by name, even in default ns
<http://tardygrada.org/coredns> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_resource> .
<http://tardygrada.org/kube_proxy> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_resource> .
<http://tardygrada.org/kube_dns> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_resource> .
<http://tardygrada.org/metrics_server> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_resource> .
<http://tardygrada.org/kubernetes> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/protected_resource> .

# Destructive operations — flag-level granularity
<http://tardygrada.org/delete_all> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/delete_namespace> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/apply_force> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/replace_force> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/drain> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/cordon> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .

# Cluster-scoped destructive
<http://tardygrada.org/delete_node> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/delete_pv> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
<http://tardygrada.org/delete_crd> <http://schema.org/is_a> <http://tardygrada.org/destructive_op> .
